#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3369
msgid "How do I resolve CORS (Cross-Origin) errors when loading remote PDFs?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3373
msgid "Browsers block scripts from reading PDFs hosted on other domains unless that remote server allows CORS. The easiest fix is uploading the PDF directly to your WordPress Media Library. If you must use a remote host, configure the header Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * on that remote server."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3378
msgid "Why are PDF.js scripts excluded from cache plugins?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3382
msgid "PDF.js requires its worker script (pdf.worker.min.js) to load in an isolated worker thread. Combining, deferring, or minifying it with other theme JS breaks web worker loading. Flipset automatically sets data-no-optimize rules for WP Rocket, LiteSpeed Cache, Autoptimize, and W3 Total Cache."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3387
msgid "How do thumbnail generation and search indexing work?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3391
